  "description": "SQL Server storage provider for DbRelay (Microsoft.Data.SqlClient): transactional outbox inserts in the caller's SqlTransaction, UPDLOCK/READPAST/ROWLOCK claiming with leases and lock tokens, retention cleanup and explicit, idempotent schema creation. Works with or without READ_COMMITTED_SNAPSHOT. Tested on SQL Server 2019, 2022 and 2025.",
